msgstr ""
"plan: swap zones '{zone}' and '{partner}' ({axis}): {here} -> '{partner}', "
"{there} -> '{zone}'; frames x={hx} y={hy} {hw}x{hh} and x={tx} y={ty} {tw}"
"x{th}"

#: zone-tiler.py
#, python-brace-format
